  "description": "Magical Boy Maple has one goal and one goal only: to protect the land from the evil hordes that seek to conquer and destroy it. Any lewd thoughts are just…a byproduct! He’s dedicated to his cause, that’s for sure, but his powers have yet to fully develop. That is, until the dark leader Daisy comes into his life. One look at those thick thighs and bulging pecs and - poof! - Maples magic comes in. And when the magical gods gift you tentacles, what else are you supposed to do if not use them…?!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
